<h2>SIP accounts - section [<i>proxy_N</i>]</h2>
The <i>proxy_N</i> sections represents SIP accounts.<br/>
Their name inherits from the legacy object name #LinphoneProxyConfig in liblinphone, that is now superseeded by
by the #LinphoneAccount and #LinphoneAccountParams object, but the linphonerc section name was left unchanged to preserve configuration file compatibility.
<table>
	<caption id="sip_account_parameters">SIP account parameters</caption>
	<tr><th>Key<th>Value type<th>Possible values<th>Default value<th>API</th>
	\if DOXYFILE_USE_COPYBRIEF
		<th>Description</th>
	\endif
	</tr>
	<tr><td>reg_identity</td><td>string</td><td>SIP address</td><td>""</td><td>linphone_account_params_set_identity_address()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_account_params_set_identity_address</td></tr>
	<tr><td>reg_proxy</td><td>string</td><td>SIP address</td><td>""</td><td>linphone_account_params_set_server_address()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_account_params_set_server_address</td></tr>
	<tr><td>reg_route</td><td>string</td><td>SIP address</td><td>""</td><td>linphone_account_params_set_routes_addresses()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_account_params_set_routes_addresses</td></tr>
	<tr><td>reg_sendregister</td><td>boolean</td><td>0 or 1</td><td>1</td><td>linphone_account_params_enable_register()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_account_params_enable_register</td></tr>
	<tr><td>reg_expires</td><td>integer</td><td>any strictly positive integer</td><td>3600</td><td>linphone_account_params_set_expires()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_account_params_set_expires</td></tr>
	<tr><td>realm</td><td>string</td><td>any string</td><td>""</td><td>linphone_account_params_set_realm()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_account_params_set_realm</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Remote contact directories - section [<i>remote_contact_directory_N</i>]</h2>

Their role is not to present a permanent list of contacts to the user, but rather return, per a search request, a list of contacts that match the request.<br/>
The search request is transmitted through the protocol (LDAP or CardDav), and executed on the server. The server's response is analysed and search results are represented as a list of #LinphoneFriend objects.<br/>
LDAP connection configuration has it is own password key, and it is not relying at all on the #LinphoneAuthInfo objects, unlike all other liblinphone initiated connections.<br/>
Table \ref remote_contact_directory_parameters "remote contact directory parameters" lists all remote contact directory parameters one may find under section [<i>remote_contact_directory_N</i>] of a Linphone RC file.<br/>
<table>
	<caption id="remote_contact_directory_parameters">Remote Contact directory parameters</caption>
	<tr><th>Key<th>Value type<th>Possible values<th>Default value<th>API</th>
	\if DOXYFILE_USE_COPYBRIEF
		<th>Description</th>
	\endif
	</tr>
	<tr><td>enabled</td><td>integer</td><td>0 or 1</td><td>1</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_enable()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_enable</td></tr>
	<tr><td>type</td><td>string</td><td>carddav or ldap</td><td>""</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_get_type()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_get_type</td></tr>
	<tr><td>uri</td><td>string</td><td>a URI</td><td>""</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_server_url()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_server_url</td></tr>
	<tr><td>min_characters</td><td>integer</td><td>any positive integer or 0</td><td>3</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_min_characters()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_min_characters</td></tr>
	<tr><td>results_limit</td><td>integer</td><td>any positive integer or 0</td><td>0</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_limit()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_limit</td></tr>
	<tr><td>timeout</td><td>integer</td><td>any positive integer or 0</td><td>5</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_timeout()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_timeout</td></tr>
	<tr><td>delay</td><td>integer</td><td>any positive integer or 0</td><td>500</td><td>linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_delay()</td><td>\copybrief linphone_remote_contact_directory_set_delay</td></tr>
</table>
